WEBVTT

00:00:00.256 --> 00:00:04.289
Under Configure, open AHV Uplink Migration and choose PE

00:00:04.309 --> 00:00:07.554
direct. Prism Central is not required for this path.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.906
Enter the expected cluster UUID, PE endpoint and saved

00:00:11.947 --> 00:00:16.286
PE credential. Provide the CVM credential reference and independently verified

00:00:16.497 --> 00:00:19.742
SSH host-key fingerprints for every CVM.

00:00:19.911 --> 00:00:22.653
Keep the required CVM-to-host trust intact.

00:00:22.969 --> 00:00:27.366
New deployment and recovery drafts leave PE certificate verification optional

00:00:27.406 --> 00:00:29.286
with a per-run exception reason.

00:00:29.454 --> 00:00:33.914
Review that reason and the risk: HTTPS remains encrypted, but

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:37.250
the certificate no longer authenticates the PE endpoint.

00:00:37.448 --> 00:00:41.397
The exception is included in the plan, independent approval and audit.

00:00:41.501 --> 00:00:44.348
It never bypasses SSH host-key checks.

00:00:44.531 --> 00:00:49.098
Run read-only discovery and verify identity, complete membership, health

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:53.353
and inventory. Choose Create a new virtual switch, such as V S one,

00:00:53.373 --> 00:00:55.786
or a consistent existing destination.

00:00:55.934 --> 00:01:00.468
In PE-direct mode, V S one maps to local bridge B R one.

00:01:00.647 --> 00:01:05.022
For every host, retain at least two operational uplinks on B R zero and

00:01:05.042 --> 00:01:09.353
two at the destination. Review cabling, VLANs, MTU,

00:01:09.394 --> 00:01:11.366
capacity and console access.

00:01:11.627 --> 00:01:15.661
Run read-only preflight and have a different administrator approve the exact

00:01:15.681 --> 00:01:19.757
assignments. Packaged appliances enable reviewed live application by

00:01:19.777 --> 00:01:23.780
default. An explicit host override can retain planning mode.

00:01:23.982 --> 00:01:27.461
Confirm representative hardware validation for your environment;

00:01:27.523 --> 00:01:30.947
a passed draft or mock test does not establish it.

00:01:31.177 --> 00:01:35.680
After the required checks and confirmation, the approved worker processes hosts

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:40.310
sequentially and verifies retained management
connectivity and both assignments.

00:01:40.478 --> 00:01:43.920
A failed or uncertain action stops later hosts.

00:01:44.116 --> 00:01:48.277
Keep completed work recorded and reconcile the actual bridges before a new

00:01:48.297 --> 00:01:51.835
plan; there is no automatic retry or rollback.
